DEVICE SPIKE

# Rover basics 6 - crater detour (reference solution).
DEFINE quarter turn left:
  set movement speed 15
  reset yaw
  start moving steering -100
  wait until spike angle yaw < -87
  stop movement

DEFINE quarter turn right:
  set movement speed 15
  reset yaw
  start moving steering 100
  wait until spike angle yaw > 87
  stop movement

WHEN flag clicked:
  set movement motors A B
  set movement speed 50
  move forward 25 cm
  quarter turn left
  set movement speed 50
  move forward 33 cm
  quarter turn right
  set movement speed 50
  move forward 83 cm
